# BeanQuery's site for ysto's Caddy (docs/DEPLOY.md). Copied to the VPS's Caddy sites folder with the real domain in
# place of beans.example.org. Caddy gets and renews its certificate and redirects HTTP to HTTPS. The app sets its own
# security headers, HSTS included. No access log is configured, so no client address is written.
beans.example.org {
	encode zstd gzip
	header -Server
	reverse_proxy beanquery:3000
}
